  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Evelyn**: back after 73 archived shows (1457 days); rare: 3 archived performances [2]\n- **Death Is The Easy Way**: back after 145 archived shows (2497 days); rare: 14 archived performances [2]\n- **Touch Me pt 1**: back after 62 archived shows (1299 days); rare: 3 archived performances [2]\n- **Phone**: back after 106 archived shows (2095 days); mythic rare: 2 archived performances [2]\n- **Isn't It A Pity**: rare: 6 archived performances [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **MMJ2012-08-26.CM-33** (recommended): source not stated; 21 songs; 139 min [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Ben Bridwell of Band of Horses sang with My Morning Jacket on one marked song [1]\n- Band of Horses and Seth Kaufman of Floating Action joined the band onstage for another marked number [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **MMJ2012-08-26.CM-33**: taped by NSL; transferred by NSL; source: Berliner CM-33's > Naiant Littlebox > Sony PCM-M10 (24/48) [1]. Also: Recorded from section 2, row U, seat 12, with the microphones about eight feet off the ground [1]",
